WEBVTT

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:11.730
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:17.240
<i>tsukanoma no yasuragi mo furikitte</i>
Shaking off the desire to rest

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:23.410
<i>hitasura massugu ni hashiri tsuzuketa</i>
I resume my forward journey

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:26.540
<i>nagareru ase nuguwazuni</i>
Without wiping the sweat off my brow

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:34.590
<i>butsukarukotode fukaku musubitsuku yuujou</i>
The friendship that grows through fighting

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:40.680
<i>kizutsuitakoto wa mudaja nakattane</i>
Getting hurt was never a waste

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:45.600
<i>kanashimi ni kureta toki</i>
When you're wallowing in sorrow

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:49.730
<i>sotto te o sashinobete miyou</i>
Let's reach out with your hand

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:52.940
<i>kitto itsumademo tomo wa</i>
I'm sure friends will be there

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:57.200
<i>kimi o mimamotte iru</i>
Watching over you

00:00:57.360 --> 00:01:00.620
<i>hitorija naikara</i>
Since we are not alone

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:04.620
<i>chikaiaou kitto</i>
Let's swear to each other

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:09.380
<i>itsuka jidai ga kawattemo</i>
That even when times change

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:12.380
<i>boku wa wasurenai</i>
I will never forget you

00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:16.630
I trust you forever

00:01:56.880 --> 00:01:58.510
Now, everyone.

00:01:58.510 --> 00:02:01.090
In this world you'll find
some terrifying Fighters.

00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:03.390
Why do I say this?

00:02:03.390 --> 00:02:05.560
Well, every opponent selected to
go against this Fighter...

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:08.850
...is suddenly found dead.

00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:12.060
The Fighter is Kyral,
the Grim Reaper.

00:02:12.770 --> 00:02:13.980
That's beautiful.

00:02:13.980 --> 00:02:15.920
Yet another victory by default.

00:02:16.650 --> 00:02:19.320
And your turn is
coming up next...

00:02:19.320 --> 00:02:20.740
...Domon Kasshu!

00:02:23.990 --> 00:02:32.460
Neo Japan Neo Nepal
God Gundam Mandala Gundam

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:27.120
Domon had declared that...
...he would sweep the matches.

00:02:27.120 --> 00:02:29.830
But will he safely make it...
...to fight this mysterious Fighter...

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:32.460
...and his Mandala Gundam?

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:34.000
And now!

00:02:34.590 --> 00:02:38.720
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:44.760
Domon Targeted!
The Assassin's Staff

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:46.640
<i>Now, everybody</i>...

00:02:46.640 --> 00:02:48.890
...<i>today, in the Gundam Fight</i>
<i>Finals Tournament</i>...

00:02:48.890 --> 00:02:53.190
...<i>the match between Viking</i>
<i>Gundam of Neo Norway</i>...

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:58.440
...<i>and Gundam Spiegel of</i>
<i>Neo Germany is coming to a close</i>.

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:01.030
<i>Look at that!</i>

00:03:01.030 --> 00:03:04.530
<i>Viking Gundam's attacking</i>
<i>with his specialty oar weapons!</i>

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:14.040
<i>The always splendid Spiegel</i>
<i>has been on the defensive!</i>

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:17.800
Well, I think it's about time
I finish you off!

00:03:23.420 --> 00:03:26.300
How about this?!

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:27.850
That's nothing!

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:35.810
I got him!

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:41.440
<i>Wow! It's the</i>
<i>substitution technique!</i>

00:03:42.030 --> 00:03:43.280
Wh-what?!

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:44.450
Not so easy.

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:45.910
I'm over here!

00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:57.590
He did it!

00:03:57.590 --> 00:04:00.710
<i>Fighter Schwarz Bruder has</i>
<i>chalked up his second win!</i>

00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:04.430
<i>And rescue workers are heading</i>
<i>over to Viking Gundam!</i>

00:04:07.430 --> 00:04:11.350
<i>Wow, look at</i>
<i>his sportsmanship!</i>

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:13.730
<i>Schwarz Bruder, a great Fighter!</i>

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:17.730
Awesome...

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:20.480
It's over before I could
figure out what was going on.

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:23.110
Really, it happened
almost like magic.

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:25.070
Hey, Rain.

00:04:25.070 --> 00:04:27.450
Comparing that Gundam
and Domon's...

00:04:27.450 --> 00:04:28.740
...which one's stronger?

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:29.240
Huh?

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:30.540
That's obvious!

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:33.710
It's God Gundam!
Right, Domon?!

00:04:34.870 --> 00:04:37.080
Yeah, that's right. Probably...

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:40.670
Not "probably." For sure!

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:41.630
For sure?

00:04:41.630 --> 00:04:43.630
You bet! For sure!

00:04:43.630 --> 00:04:45.340
For sure! For sure! For sure!

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:47.260
Tell me it's for sure!

00:04:47.260 --> 00:04:49.010
Hi! Rain!

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:52.770
What a coincidence seeing you
here like this!

00:04:53.680 --> 00:04:54.930
How about dinner?

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:56.730
Well, I'll, uh...

00:04:56.730 --> 00:04:58.810
...pass on your kind offer,
Chibodee.

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:04.860
Rain belongs to Domon!

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:06.820
I'm not going to let you
get in the way!

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:08.950
"Belongs to Domon"?

00:05:08.950 --> 00:05:10.030
Wait a sec...

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:11.950
Chibodee, spying on us?

00:05:11.950 --> 00:05:12.990
Domon...

00:05:12.990 --> 00:05:15.120
...since when did you
open up a daycare?

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:16.000
Go away!

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:17.620
You're being a pest!

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:19.040
Listen.

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:21.790
Rain and Domon are just friends.

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:25.130
There's nothing wrong with me
asking Rain out on a date.

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:25.720
All right?

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:28.970
Is that true?

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:30.050
Is that so?

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:32.220
Guys...

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:39.850
By the way, Domon...

00:05:39.850 --> 00:05:42.400
...I hear Grim Reaper's after you.

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:43.320
The Grim Reaper?

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:45.150
Didn't you know?

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:47.280
He'll be your next opponent.

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:49.990
"Fighter Kyral Mekirel
of Neo Nepal...

00:05:49.990 --> 00:05:52.620
...Wins Again by Default".

00:05:53.030 --> 00:05:54.660
Was he assassinated?

00:05:55.310 --> 00:05:59.180
You better avoid walking
down unlit streets at night.

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:02.290
I do appreciate your warning,
Chibodee.

00:06:02.290 --> 00:06:04.000
But it looks like you're too late.

00:06:04.420 --> 00:06:05.250
What?!

00:06:09.220 --> 00:06:11.220
Domon Kasshu, I presume.

00:06:11.760 --> 00:06:13.050
What do you want?

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:16.560
You shall perish.

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:22.560
What?! Right here, in the streets?!

00:06:23.020 --> 00:06:25.070
Location is not a concern.

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:29.490
You won't get away!

00:06:31.570 --> 00:06:32.410
Damn!

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:34.700
Who'd ever expect he'd strike
in broad daylight?!

00:06:34.700 --> 00:06:35.200
Domon!

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:37.250
Leave it to me.
You wait right here!

00:06:40.460 --> 00:06:42.290
It looks like I lost him.

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:47.710
It's him!

00:06:51.610 --> 00:06:54.260
Don't expect to get away from me.

00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:55.260
What?!

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:04.020
He can't attack in this darkness.

00:07:04.590 --> 00:07:05.570
Think so?

00:07:07.780 --> 00:07:10.280
The darkness you speak of
has no bearing on me!

00:07:11.140 --> 00:07:11.780
What?!

00:07:26.460 --> 00:07:27.710
What the...?!

00:07:31.220 --> 00:07:33.800
You should've let me put you
out of your misery with one blow.

00:07:35.140 --> 00:07:36.390
You're blind!

00:07:36.890 --> 00:07:38.310
It makes no difference.

00:07:40.600 --> 00:07:42.600
He's using a long staff.

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:43.390
But...

00:07:43.390 --> 00:07:46.110
...if I can sneak right up to him,
that staff will be useless.

00:07:47.980 --> 00:07:49.400
Here I go!

00:07:58.790 --> 00:08:00.330
Gotcha!

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:01.660
You sure?

00:08:02.830 --> 00:08:03.710
A hidden blade?!

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:08.340
Domon!

00:08:09.500 --> 00:08:10.460
D-Domon!

00:08:10.460 --> 00:08:11.260
Hang in there!

00:08:13.090 --> 00:08:14.250
Goddamn!

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:19.510
For now, we'd better retreat!

00:08:21.810 --> 00:08:23.140
Oh, no!

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:49.040
I'll take care of him later.

00:08:58.180 --> 00:09:00.150
Jesus...!

00:09:02.220 --> 00:09:02.770
What?!

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:04.100
You didn't get him?!

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:06.270
There's no excuse for that.

00:09:06.270 --> 00:09:09.110
The match against Neo Japan
is only two days away!

00:09:10.610 --> 00:09:14.570
The two paths in the world of
assassins are to live or to perish.

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:18.240
Which will all depend
on my skills and luck.

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:19.660
So, there will be times like these.

00:09:20.070 --> 00:09:22.200
You're taking this too lightly!

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:22.870
Listen well.

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:27.670
You lost your eyesight and were once
kicked out of the Gundam Fight.

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:30.730
Why do you think our government
hired you?

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:36.130
It's only because of your skills
as an assassin!

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:40.720
Yes, I'm a professional assassin.

00:09:40.720 --> 00:09:43.220
Sooner or later,
I will hit my target.

00:09:43.470 --> 00:09:46.100
So you just keep quiet and
leave it to me.

00:09:56.320 --> 00:10:00.740
You have nothing to worry about.
Domon Kasshu will be stopped.

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:11.880
Kyral started off
as a genuine Fighter.

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:15.090
It was at the 11th Tournament.

00:10:15.630 --> 00:10:19.300
He was thought by many
as a competitor favored to win.

00:10:19.880 --> 00:10:21.390
He was highly skilled.

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:25.850
He used his powers and defeated
his enemies, one after another.

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:36.730
But, then...

00:10:36.730 --> 00:10:38.860
...in the final stage
of the tournament...

00:10:42.780 --> 00:10:46.040
...he let his guard down for
only an instant.

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:47.670
I-it won't budge!

00:10:50.620 --> 00:10:53.880
That was the last light
he would ever see.

00:10:58.090 --> 00:11:01.340
After what happened, he was
finished as a Fighter.

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:05.370
They got rid of him fast.

00:11:09.930 --> 00:11:12.940
Then how did he return
as a Fighter?

00:11:13.100 --> 00:11:14.690
I'd say that it was...

00:11:14.690 --> 00:11:17.860
...the hatred for the Gundam Fight
responsible for taking his sight.

00:11:17.860 --> 00:11:20.450
He's returned as the Grim Reaper...

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:22.220
...for revenge.

00:11:27.160 --> 00:11:30.960
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:11:45.010 --> 00:11:47.930
Okay, Bro.
Let's do it one more time!

00:11:54.900 --> 00:11:56.150
It's the same as before!

00:11:56.150 --> 00:11:59.780
The best I can do is
dodge these poles!

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:02.110
How can I overcome this?

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:06.070
I have to get right up to him.

00:12:09.240 --> 00:12:10.620
So there!

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:15.170
Bro, it's just no use.

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:16.920
He's right.

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:19.090
With the range the guy
can cover with his stick...

00:12:19.090 --> 00:12:20.880
...you just don't have the reach.

00:12:21.590 --> 00:12:25.970
And if I dodge his staff and get in
close to him, his blade is waiting.

00:12:28.100 --> 00:12:29.750
What can I do?

00:12:29.750 --> 00:12:31.220
B-Bro.

00:12:31.570 --> 00:12:33.430
O-over there.

00:12:38.610 --> 00:12:39.360
Kyral!

00:12:39.610 --> 00:12:41.570
The guy doesn't know when to quit!

00:12:41.940 --> 00:12:42.900
That's him?!

00:12:42.900 --> 00:12:43.630
Stop.

00:12:44.490 --> 00:12:45.910
Look at his feet.

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:49.030
He's standing on a leaf and...

00:12:49.030 --> 00:12:51.740
...floating by focusing all of
his senses on that one point.

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:54.210
Such incredible concentration.

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:58.040
Anyone carelessly attacking him
will easily be defeated.

00:12:59.340 --> 00:13:01.300
You've done your homework.

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:03.380
Then be prepared for
the inevitable!

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:07.640
You're all wimps, with that
friendship drivel of yours!

00:13:07.640 --> 00:13:11.220
It's my duty to send all of you
to the other world!

00:13:12.970 --> 00:13:14.310
I'll teach you a lesson...

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:17.940
...that on the battleground you've
got only yourself to depend on!

00:13:18.150 --> 00:13:18.810
Bastard!

00:13:18.810 --> 00:13:19.440
Chibodee!

00:13:26.310 --> 00:13:27.240
What the...?!

00:13:28.570 --> 00:13:29.450
Listen to me!

00:13:29.450 --> 00:13:30.990
I will never forget it!

00:13:30.990 --> 00:13:33.950
The Gundam Fight that took
my sight away from me!

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:35.460
That's right!

00:13:35.460 --> 00:13:38.830
I'll give you a taste of what it's
like to be in this world's darkness!

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:56.310
Damn...

00:13:56.310 --> 00:13:59.310
As it is, I got no way to
beat this guy.

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:00.940
So, what can I do?

00:14:02.070 --> 00:14:04.900
Worrying about it won't help you,
not with your brain!

00:14:07.450 --> 00:14:08.490
It's Schwarz!

00:14:09.530 --> 00:14:10.780
Domon...

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:15.660
...aren't you just afraid of a technique
Kyral used on you only once?

00:14:16.160 --> 00:14:17.290
That's not true.

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:18.370
Then...

00:14:18.370 --> 00:14:21.000
...whatever happened to your
Meikyo Shisui?

00:14:26.090 --> 00:14:28.220
I'll make you remember it,
Domon!

00:14:29.090 --> 00:14:29.760
What?

00:14:35.890 --> 00:14:37.640
Th-this is...

00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:40.520
Goodbye, Domon!

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:54.160
<i>Everybody</i>...

00:14:54.160 --> 00:14:56.700
...<i>we're here live at the</i>
<i>Queens Road East Ring</i>...

00:14:56.700 --> 00:14:58.960
...<i>bringing you the</i>
<i>match between</i>...

00:14:58.960 --> 00:15:00.620
...<i>God Gundam and</i>
<i>Mandala Gundam</i>.

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:05.000
<i>Mandala Gundam has won</i>
<i>all of his matches by default</i>.

00:15:05.000 --> 00:15:08.210
<i>It will be interesting to see how</i>
<i>he does in an actual Fight</i>.

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:14.510
- Go get him, Bro!
- Come on, Domon!

00:15:17.310 --> 00:15:20.270
He allowed Domon
to enter the ring after all.

00:15:20.270 --> 00:15:22.690
Kyral, the Grim Reaper,
has grown soft.

00:15:23.730 --> 00:15:25.270
There's nothing to worry about.

00:15:32.490 --> 00:15:34.160
I hereby proclaim
the commencement of...

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:38.330
...the match between God
Gundam and Mandala Gundam!

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:39.910
Gundam Fight!

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:41.250
Ready!

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:42.540
Go!

00:15:50.210 --> 00:15:51.340
Domon!

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:52.470
Get him!

00:15:52.760 --> 00:15:55.600
<i>Mandala Gundam has launched</i>
<i>attacks with its staff!</i>

00:15:55.600 --> 00:15:58.060
<i>God Gundam is barely</i>
<i>able to dodge them!</i>

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:00.060
What's the matter, Domon?

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:01.390
Hurry and use your God Finger.

00:16:01.390 --> 00:16:02.640
No. Can't do it.

00:16:02.640 --> 00:16:06.440
If he tries to get in close,
that blade will be waiting for him.

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:07.860
He can't rely on God Finger.

00:16:08.150 --> 00:16:09.070
What?

00:16:10.650 --> 00:16:13.950
<i>Well! God Gundam has been</i>
<i>pushed up against the barrier!</i>

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:16.200
What's wrong?

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:17.870
Having trouble fighting back?

00:16:18.080 --> 00:16:20.120
Then how about this?!

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:21.790
Rengoku Reppu!

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:26.750
<i>Wh-what a tremendous inferno!</i>

00:16:26.750 --> 00:16:30.300
<i>God Gundam is wrapped</i>
<i>in Mandala Gundam's flames!</i>

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:32.420
Come on, Domon!

00:16:39.850 --> 00:16:43.890
At last we'll see an end to
that obnoxious samurai boy.

00:16:43.890 --> 00:16:45.350
Think so?

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:49.940
I heard Kyral has already failed in
an attempt to assassinate Domon.

00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:53.030
And that could prove fatal...

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:54.650
...against a disciple of the
"Undefeated of the East."

00:16:54.820 --> 00:16:56.780
Then, I'll watch with
great interest...

00:16:56.780 --> 00:16:59.410
...for that winning home run
in the bottom of the ninth.

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:03.160
Will you just get roasted
to a crisp...

00:17:03.160 --> 00:17:06.290
...or will you come at me,
the Grim Reaper...

00:17:06.290 --> 00:17:08.330
...so I can take out your head?!

00:17:10.880 --> 00:17:11.750
Remember!

00:17:11.750 --> 00:17:13.920
Remember the Meikyo Shisui!

00:17:14.340 --> 00:17:15.430
That's right.

00:17:15.430 --> 00:17:17.140
Fearing for my life won't help me.

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:19.430
Fearing the enemy won't help me!

00:17:20.010 --> 00:17:22.060
I'm the King of Hearts!

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:23.850
The strongest man around!

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:33.940
This hand of mine is burning red!

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:37.320
Its loud roar tells me
to grasp victory!

00:17:37.320 --> 00:17:38.740
Erupting...

00:17:38.780 --> 00:17:40.070
No, Domon!

00:17:40.070 --> 00:17:41.700
That's what he wants you to do!

00:17:41.950 --> 00:17:46.960
...God Finger!

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:48.500
You fool!

00:17:53.380 --> 00:17:54.380
What?

00:17:55.130 --> 00:17:56.090
Domon!

00:18:00.970 --> 00:18:02.600
How?!

00:18:07.890 --> 00:18:09.100
Kyral Mekirel.

00:18:09.940 --> 00:18:11.020
In Gundam Fights...

00:18:11.020 --> 00:18:14.820
...one's life may be at stake,
but it's not the world of assassins.

00:18:15.280 --> 00:18:17.900
It's about winning and losing
in the ring.

00:18:18.200 --> 00:18:19.990
You have forgotten that...

00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:23.240
...and showed me your trump card
before our match.

00:18:23.740 --> 00:18:27.330
The same trick will never work
twice against the King of Hearts!

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:32.920
You're a disgrace to the nation!

00:18:34.840 --> 00:18:38.340
Erupting God Slash!

00:18:40.920 --> 00:18:42.510
I see.

00:18:42.510 --> 00:18:45.080
So you want to determine
who the true winner is.

00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:47.520
Then come on!

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:48.660
Okay!

00:18:54.730 --> 00:18:56.480
They're equally on their guard.

00:18:56.820 --> 00:18:57.650
Unreal.

00:18:58.320 --> 00:18:59.990
One move will decide this match.

00:19:07.950 --> 00:19:09.120
Domon...

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:15.170
Domon!

00:19:15.170 --> 00:19:18.010
I'll show you the truth
right here and now!

00:19:18.010 --> 00:19:21.180
My hatred spawned from being
thrown out of the tournament!

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:24.930
You shall feel my hatred!

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:27.520
Then I shall slash you!

00:19:56.790 --> 00:19:57.960
Domon!

00:20:00.840 --> 00:20:02.470
Great move, Domon.

00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:06.030
I'm pleased that I was able to
fight at least one more time...

00:20:06.030 --> 00:20:07.890
...against a man like yourself.

00:20:07.890 --> 00:20:10.520
I truly enjoyed this match.

00:20:17.610 --> 00:20:20.030
And God Gundam is the winner!

00:20:20.030 --> 00:20:22.700
All right! All right!

00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:23.990
You're useless!

00:20:23.990 --> 00:20:25.450
In that case...

00:20:27.370 --> 00:20:29.700
In order to destroy evidence
of Kyral's work...

00:20:29.700 --> 00:20:31.290
...I'll have to destroy him.

00:20:31.660 --> 00:20:32.870
Now, hold it right there!

00:20:34.370 --> 00:20:37.340
You're very thorough to
rid yourself of evidence.

00:20:37.340 --> 00:20:38.960
But I won't let you do it.

00:20:39.670 --> 00:20:42.170
If you don't cooperate,
I'll have Kyral disclose...

00:20:42.170 --> 00:20:44.430
...all of the Fighter
assassinations to date!

00:20:46.510 --> 00:20:47.640
Do as you wish.

00:20:47.970 --> 00:20:49.220
Very well.

00:20:49.220 --> 00:20:51.720
Domon! That was a great fight!

00:20:54.440 --> 00:20:55.850
I see.

00:20:55.850 --> 00:20:59.230
Domon Kasshu certainly provided
us with an entertaining battle.

00:20:59.610 --> 00:21:01.900
I cannot wait until
his next match.

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:05.410
Domon.

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:08.280
I'll always be waiting for
my opportunity with you.

00:21:25.130 --> 00:21:26.880
Domon Kasshu...

00:21:26.880 --> 00:21:28.840
...I shall never forget.

00:21:29.140 --> 00:21:30.180
Yes.

00:21:30.180 --> 00:21:31.720
In the final moments...

00:21:32.140 --> 00:21:34.730
...the images of your
supportive friends.

00:21:34.930 --> 00:21:36.100
I never thought...

00:21:36.100 --> 00:21:40.440
...I'd see anything so wonderful
again with these eyes.

00:21:43.360 --> 00:21:45.820
I thank you! Farewell!

00:21:48.950 --> 00:21:51.580
Where could he be headed?

00:21:51.930 --> 00:21:53.910
He's leaving the assassin's world.

00:21:53.910 --> 00:21:57.670
He's devoting himself to praying
for the souls of those he killed.

00:21:58.120 --> 00:22:00.170
He knows better than anyone...

00:22:00.170 --> 00:22:03.170
...that his crimes are too horrible
for anybody to comprehend...

00:22:03.170 --> 00:22:06.380
...and that he could never be
forgiven for what he's done.

00:22:07.050 --> 00:22:09.470
Good bye, Kyral.

00:22:24.530 --> 00:22:28.320
<i>Donna yume o miteru no</i>
What are you dreaming of?

00:22:28.320 --> 00:22:30.820
<i>Odayaka na negao</i>
Your peaceful sleeping face

00:22:32.330 --> 00:22:36.120
<i>itoshikute kimi no kata</i>
Your gentle, warm shoulders

00:22:36.120 --> 00:22:38.670
<i>sotto dakiyoseta</i>
I draw them closer to me

00:22:39.620 --> 00:22:43.800
<i>hiroi kono tokai de</i>
In this great city

00:22:43.800 --> 00:22:47.470
<i>kimi to mukaeru asa ga</i>
The morning I greet with you

00:22:47.470 --> 00:22:54.180
<i>ichiban taisetsu dakara</i>
Is the most important thing to me

00:22:54.430 --> 00:23:01.730
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa ubaikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot find love

00:23:02.020 --> 00:23:06.280
<i>sou dareka kizutsuketemo</i>
Even if you were to hurt someone

00:23:06.480 --> 00:23:09.860
<i>kimi no egao dake wa yuzurenai</i>
I will never give up your smiling face

00:23:09.900 --> 00:23:17.330
<i>yasashisa dakeja ai wa mamorikirenai</i>
With kindness alone, one cannot protect love

00:23:17.330 --> 00:23:26.170
<i>kimidake o itsumo mitsumeteru</i>
I am always gazing only at you

00:23:33.010 --> 00:23:34.930
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:37.470
Despite his approaching battle
against Mermaid Gundam...

00:23:37.470 --> 00:23:39.680
...Sai Saici is feeling
blissfully happy.

00:23:39.680 --> 00:23:44.900
He can't get his mind off of
Cecile, a beautiful girl he met.

00:23:45.360 --> 00:23:46.730
However...

00:23:46.730 --> 00:23:50.280
...the two will soon discover the
ironic fate that awaits them!

00:23:50.780 --> 00:23:52.950
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:52.950 --> 00:23:57.080
Running Away!
Sai Saici in Love

00:23:54.370 --> 00:24:00.930
Running Away!
Sai Saici in Love

00:23:57.080 --> 00:23:59.120
Ready! Go!
